{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["MAGICAL GIRL RAISING PROJECT restart","Some magical girls fight. Others do not. Chosen by the mysterious Land of Magic, which exists unbeknownst to the rest of the world, magical girls are each granted a unique power. Pechka, whose magic makes food delicious, is forced to take part in a mysterious virtual game together with 16 unfamiliar magical girls, each with her own distinctive personality. It was supposed to be a safe training exercise designed to improve their magical abilities. But instead, it marks the beginning of a carefully orchestrated nightmare - a forbidden trial. A new Magical Girl Raising Project has begun.\n\n\n\n(Source: OceanVeil)"],"ja":["魔法少女育成計画 restart",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":33003,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-54344","ids":{"shikimori":54344,"mal":54344,"anilist":160803,"kodik":"serial-78653"},"kodikIds":["serial-78584","serial-78596","serial-78653"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-78584":"2026-10-19T19:06:34Z","serial-78596":"2026-10-19T20:37:07Z","serial-78653":"2026-10-21T05:10:46Z"},"title":"Проект воспитания девочек-волшебниц: Перезагрузка","originalTitle":"Mahou Shoujo Ikusei Keikaku Restart","alt":"Проект воспитания девочек-волшебниц: Перезагрузка / Проект воспитания девочек-волшебниц: Перезапуск / Magical Girl Raising Project Restart MAGICAL GIRL RAISING PROJECT restart 魔法少女育成計画 restart","description":"Смертельная игра возвращается! Шестнадцать волшебниц снова собраны для участия в испытании, где ставки невероятно высоки. Каждые три дня их Волшебные Телефоны затягивают девушек в симуляцию наподобие RPG, где им предстоит сообща сражаться с врагами, решать головоломки и добывать Волшебные Конфеты, чтобы продвинуться дальше. В конце их ждёт колоссальная награда — десять миллиардов иен, но получить её сможет лишь та, что нанесёт финальный удар. Когда на кону такой соблазнительный приз, лишь вопрос времени, когда девушки начнут предавать друг друга — а если их очки жизни упадут до нуля, надпись «game over» станет далеко не самой страшной вещью, которая их ждёт...","year":2026,"type":"TV","genres":["Экшен","Триллер","жестокост","игра с высокими ставками","махо седзе","выживание"],"rating":6.68,"popularity":7273,"ongoing":true,"relatedMalIds":[33003],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/54344/53d36cf377f290e2b075ef312a2439cd.jpeg","width":426,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/005e1a08e6c3eb18b50db8dccfd2205a2bdd4f09.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":2,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1895","dubId":"1895","label":"FumoDub","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78584","translationId":"1895","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1674859/6446124e90c08dd3c0553da043ec6385/720p","season":2,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78596","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1674914/a86ba91dd07ee1707a9f48958b1d3697/720p","season":2,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1978","dubId":"1978","label":"Dream Cast","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78653","translationId":"1978","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1675223/563fd87e77e390666ecbbc0fd19763d4/720p","season":2,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":2,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1895","dubId":"1895","label":"FumoDub","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validati